{'symbol': 'TWTR', 'date': '2020-07-23 09:30:00', 'title': 'TWITTER REPORTS Q2 GAAP LOSS OF $1.56 PER SHARE', 'text': 'QUARTERLY REPORTED GAAP LOSS PER SHARE $1.56.QUARTERLY NON-GAAP LOSS PER SHARE $1.39.QUARTERLY TOTAL REVENUE $683.4 MILLION, VERSUS $841.4 MILLION.EXCLUDING IMPACT OF INCOME TAX EXPENSE DUE TO ESTABLISHMENT OF VALUATION ALLOWANCE, Q2 ADJUSTED LOSS PER SHARE WAS $0.16.Q2 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $-0.00, REVENUE VIEW $707.5 MILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.QUARTERLY ADVERTISING REVENUE $562 MILLION, DOWN 23% OR 22% ON CONSTANT CURRENCY BASIS.ENDED THE QUARTER WITH ABOUT $7.8 BILLION IN CASH, CASH EQUIVALENTS, AND MARKETABLE SECURITIES.QUARTERLY AVERAGE MONETIZABLE DAILY ACTIVE USERS WERE 186 MILLION, VERSUS 139 MILLION.QUARTERLY AVERAGE U.S. MDAU 36 MILLION VERSUS 29 MILLION.QUARTERLY AVERAGE INTERNATIONAL MDAU 150 MILLION, VERSUS 110 MILLION.BELIEVE TOTAL COSTS AND EXPENSES WILL INCREASE 10% OR MORE IN Q3.EXPECT TO RECOGNIZE MORE STOCK-BASED COMPENSATION EXPENSE IN Q2 RELATIVE TO OTHER QUARTERS IN 2020.SAYS IN Q2, RECOGNIZED DEFERRED TAX ASSET VALUATION ALLOWANCE OF $1.1 BILLION.IN Q2, RECOGNIZED NON-CASH INCOME TAX EXPENSE BASED PRIMARILY ON CUMULATIVE TAXABLE LOSSES DRIVEN PRIMARILY BY COVID-19.TWITTER CEO SAYS IMPLEMENTED NUMEROUS SAFEGUARDS TO IMPROVE SECURITY OF INTERNAL SYSTEMS, AND WORKING WITH LAW ENFORCEMENT TO ADDRESS SECURITY ISSUE.TWITTER CEO SAYS "COMMITTED TO EARNING THE TRUST OF ALL OF OUR STAKEHOLDERS WITH OUR EVERY ACTION, INCLUDING HOW WE ADDRESS THIS SECURITY ISSUE".'}{'symbol': 'TWTR', 'date': '2020-07-23 09:30:00', 'title': 'TWITTER REPORTS Q2 GAAP LOSS OF $1.56 PER SHARE', 'text': 'QUARTERLY REPORTED GAAP LOSS PER SHARE $1.56.QUARTERLY NON-GAAP LOSS PER SHARE $1.39.QUARTERLY TOTAL REVENUE $683.4 MILLION, VERSUS $841.4 MILLION.EXCLUDING IMPACT OF INCOME TAX EXPENSE DUE TO ESTABLISHMENT OF VALUATION ALLOWANCE, Q2 ADJUSTED LOSS PER SHARE WAS $0.16.Q2 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $-0.00, REVENUE VIEW $707.5 MILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.QU